# Optional online model-request test configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in with a DEDICATED, LIMITED test credential.
# The lab never reads credentials from your existing OpenCode installation
# (~/.config/opencode, ~/.local/share/opencode, auth.json), only from here.
#
# The online tier is disabled unless you run `make test-online` (or pass
# `--online` to the harness) with these values present.
#
# LAB_TEST_PROVIDER=openai            # provider id (informational)
# LAB_TEST_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini          # model id passed to `opencode run -m`
# LAB_TEST_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LAB_TEST_API_KEY=sk-REPLACE_ME      # dedicated key, revoke after testing
